Subject: [PATCH] sysmodule: add legacy SYSMODULE_CAM alias

Older bundled PSL1GHT samples (gemtest/gemsample) use SYSMODULE_CAM for the
camera module; our SDK uses SYSMODULE_CAMERA. Add a guarded #define alias.

(The companion GCM_TF_* surface-constant aliases live in our own
sdk/include/rsx/gcm_sys.h, not here, because that header is installed over
PSL1GHT's vendored rsx/gcm_sys.h — a patch to the vendored copy would be
overwritten at install time.)

diff --git a/ppu/include/sysmodule/sysmodule.h b/ppu/include/sysmodule/sysmodule.h
index 0cb9c56..b9b932c 100644
--- a/ppu/include/sysmodule/sysmodule.h
+++ b/ppu/include/sysmodule/sysmodule.h
@@ -92,6 +92,9 @@ typedef enum
 	SYSMODULE_ADEC_MP3 = 0xf01e,
 } sysModuleId;

+#ifndef SYSMODULE_CAM
+#define SYSMODULE_CAM								SYSMODULE_CAMERA
+#endif

 s32 sysModuleLoad(sysModuleId id);
 s32 sysModuleUnload(sysModuleId id);
